IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `isl-nouns`
IMPORT `isl-p3-rates`

-- Income Support Law 5741-1980 (Israel), the First Schedule (תוספת ראשונה): persons entitled to the benefit even if they have not yet
-- reached 25 (ss 2(a)(2A), 2(d) and 5(e)(1) point here).  Layer 1: the law, objectively.
--
-- Reading a result.  Each item grants entitlement to the persons it describes.  A person who fits the description and meets the item's
-- stated conditions answers JUST TRUE.  A person outside the description answers NOTHING (limited by the item's own wording): the item says
-- nothing of anyone else.  JUST FALSE is used only where the item states a condition with "provided", "as long as", "who is not", "if", "unless"
-- and the condition fails, with the quoted words in the comment.  A cap on how long an entitlement lasts answers NOTHING once it is reached.
-- "Aged 18 or over" (מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים) is an input: the age in completed years.

§ `First Schedule item 1 -- an orphan child or a child entitled to a special benefit (ילד יתום או ילד הזכאי לגמלה מיוחדת)`

-- (c) "absent" (נעדר): lives permanently outside Israel, or his traces have vanished, or he is not known.
-- src:417 | {{ח:תת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”נעדר“ – אחד מאלה:
-- src:418 | {{ח:תתתת|(1)}} גר דרך קבע מחוץ לישראל;
-- src:419 | {{ח:תתתת|(2)}} עקבותיו נעלמו;
-- src:420 | {{ח:תתתת|(3)}} לא ידוע;
@ref sch 1 item 1(c) "נעדר" (src:417-420)
GIVEN `lives permanently outside Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `his traces have vanished` IS A BOOLEAN
      `he is not known` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 1(c) the parent is absent` MEANS
    IF `lives permanently outside Israel` OR `his traces have vanished` OR `he is not known`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "נעדר“ – אחד מאלה" (a definition that means: one of the three)

-- (c) "orphan child" (ילד יתום): orphaned of both parents, or orphaned of one parent whose other parent is absent.
-- src:415 | {{ח:תת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”ילד יתום“ – ילד יתום משני הוריו, או ילד יתום מהורה אחד והורהו השני הוא נעדר;
@ref sch 1 item 1(c) "ילד יתום" (src:415)
GIVEN `orphaned of both parents` IS A BOOLEAN
      `orphaned of one parent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the other parent is absent` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 1(c) the child is an orphan child` MEANS
    IF `orphaned of both parents`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE IF `orphaned of one parent`
         THEN `the other parent is absent`
         ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "ילד יתום“ – ילד יתום משני הוריו, או ילד יתום מהורה אחד והורהו השני הוא נעדר"

-- (c) "child entitled to a special benefit" (ילד הזכאי לגמלה מיוחדת): a child whom his parents abandoned in Israel, provided one parent is a
-- resident; or a child whom his resident parent abandoned in Israel, the other parent having died, being absent or not living with him,
-- and being permanently unable to fulfil his duties to the child; excluding a child in a foster family under the Foster Children Law 2016.
-- src:416 | {{ח:תת|סוג=הגדרה}} ”ילד הזכאי לגמלה מיוחדת“ – ילד שהוריו נטשו אותו בישראל, ובלבד שאחד מהוריו הוא תושב ישראל, או ילד שהורהו שהוא תושב ישראל נטש אותו בישראל והורהו השני נפטר, נעדר או שאינו מתגורר עמו, ונבצר ממנו דרך קבע מלמלא חובותיו כלפי הילד, ולמעט ילד במשפחת אומנה כהגדרתה {{ח:חיצוני|חוק אומנה לילדים|בחוק אומנה לילדים, התשע״ו–2016}};
@ref sch 1 item 1(c) "ילד הזכאי לגמלה מיוחדת" (src:416)
GIVEN `abandoned in Israel by his parents` IS A BOOLEAN
      `one of his parents is a resident of Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `abandoned in Israel by the parent who is a resident of Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the other parent died, is absent or does not live with him` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the other parent is permanently unable to fulfil his duties to the child` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in a foster family as the Foster Children Law defines it` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 1(c) the child is a child entitled to a special benefit` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `in a foster family as the Foster Children Law defines it` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "ולמעט ילד במשפחת אומנה"
        IF `abandoned in Israel by his parents` AND `one of his parents is a resident of Israel` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `abandoned in Israel by the parent who is a resident of Israel` AND `the other parent died, is absent or does not live with him` AND `the other parent is permanently unable to fulfil his duties to the child` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "ילד הזכאי לגמלה מיוחדת“ – ילד שהוריו נטשו אותו בישראל ... או ילד שהורהו שהוא תושב ישראל נטש אותו בישראל" (a definition that means)

-- (a): the child who is an orphan or entitled to a special benefit, and meets all of: (1) from 18 to under 20, his main time is devoted to
-- finishing school studies at a post-primary institution; (2) he is not an adopted child in the custody of the adopting parent; (3) the State
-- treasury or a local authority does not bear his upkeep.
-- src:405 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} ילד יתום או ילד הזכאי לגמלה מיוחדת, שמתקיימים בו כל אלה:
-- src:406 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} אם מלאו לו 18 שנים וטרם מלאו לו 20 שנים – עיקר זמנו מוקדש לסיום לימודיו במוסד חינוכי על יסודי;
-- src:407 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} הוא אינו ילד מאומץ הנמצא במשמורתו של ההורה המאמץ;
-- src:408 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} אוצר המדינה או רשות מקומית אינם נושאים בהחזקתו;
@ref sch 1 item 1(a) (src:405-408)
GIVEN `an orphan child or a child entitled to a special benefit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `main time is devoted to finishing studies at a post-primary educational institution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `an adopted child in the custody of the adopting parent` IS A BOOLEAN
      `upkeep borne by the State treasury or a local authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 1(a) the child meets the conditions` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `an orphan child or a child entitled to a special benefit`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the item is for an orphan child or a child entitled to a special benefit
        IF `an adopted child in the custody of the adopting parent` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(2) הוא אינו ילד מאומץ הנמצא במשמורתו של ההורה המאמץ"
        IF `upkeep borne by the State treasury or a local authority` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "(3) אוצר המדינה או רשות מקומית אינם נושאים בהחזקתו"
        IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `age in completed years` LESS THAN 20 AND (NOT `main time is devoted to finishing studies at a post-primary educational institution`) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "אם מלאו לו 18 שנים וטרם מלאו לו 20 שנים – עיקר זמנו מוקדש לסיום לימודיו במוסד חינוכי על יסודי"
        IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 20 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (1) sets a condition for 18 to under 20 and says nothing for 20 or over
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- (b): the benefit for such children: one child 25% of the basic amount less one pension point; two children 37.5% less two pension
-- points; each further child 10% of the basic amount.
-- src:409 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} הגמלה לילד יתום או לילד הזכאי לגמלה מיוחדת כאמור בפסקת משנה (א) תהיה כמפורט להלן:
-- src:410 | {{ח:תתת|(1)}} לילד אחד – 25% מהסכום הבסיסי פחות נקודת קצבה;
-- src:411 | {{ח:תתת|(2)}} לשני ילדים – 37.5% מהסכום הבסיסי פחות שתי נקודות קצבה;
-- src:412 | {{ח:תתת|(3)}} לכל ילד נוסף – 10% מהסכום הבסיסי;
@ref sch 1 item 1(b) (src:409-412)
GIVEN figures IS A Figures
      `the number of such children` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`sch 1 item 1(b) the benefit for the children` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the number of such children` EQUALS 1 THEN JUST (25% TIMES figures's `the basic amount` MINUS figures's `the value of one pension point`)
        IF `the number of such children` EQUALS 2 THEN JUST (37.5% TIMES figures's `the basic amount` MINUS 2 TIMES figures's `the value of one pension point`)
        IF `the number of such children` GREATER THAN 2 THEN JUST (37.5% TIMES figures's `the basic amount` MINUS 2 TIMES figures's `the value of one pension point` PLUS (`the number of such children` MINUS 2) TIMES 10% TIMES figures's `the basic amount`)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the paragraph gives amounts for one child, two children and each further child, not for none

-- (b1): the benefit for an orphaned or abandoned child in the custody of a relative is paid for at most six months from the day the claim was
-- filed, subject to the confirmation of the local authority's social services department, unless the person authorised at the Ministry of
-- Welfare approves going on.  "Relative" (קרוב משפחה): a brother, sister, grandfather, grandmother, uncle or aunt.
DECLARE Kin IS ONE OF
    `a brother`
    `a sister`
    `a grandfather`
    `a grandmother`
    `an uncle`
    `an aunt`
    `someone else`

-- src:413 | {{ח:תת|(ב1)}} הגמלה לילד יתום או נטוש כאמור בפסקת משנה (א) הנמצא בהחזקת קרוב משפחתו תשולם לתקופה שלא תעלה על שישה חודשים מהמועד שבו הוגשה התביעה, בכפוף למתן אישור מהמחלקה לשירותים חברתיים ברשות המקומית שבה מתגורר הילד, אלא אם כן אישר הגורם שהוסמך לכך במשרד הרווחה והשירותים החברתיים את המשך התשלום מעבר לתקופה האמורה; לעניין זה, ”קרוב משפחה“ – אח, אחות, סב, סבתא, דוד או דודה;
@ref sch 1 item 1(b1) "קרוב משפחה" (src:413)
GIVEN `the person is` IS A Kin
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 1(b1) the person is a relative` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the person is`
    WHEN `someone else` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "קרוב משפחה“ – אח, אחות, סב, סבתא, דוד או דודה" (a definition that means: a closed list)
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

@ref sch 1 item 1(b1) (src:413)
GIVEN `the child is in the custody of a relative` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the social services department of the local authority confirmed` IS A BOOLEAN
      `complete months since the claim was filed` IS A NUMBER
      `the authorised person at the Ministry of Welfare approved going on` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 1(b1) the benefit for a child in a relative's custody is paid for the month` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the child is in the custody of a relative`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the paragraph is for a child in a relative's custody
        IF (NOT `the social services department of the local authority confirmed`) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "בכפוף למתן אישור מהמחלקה לשירותים חברתיים ברשות המקומית שבה מתגורר הילד"
        IF `complete months since the claim was filed` LESS THAN 6 THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `the authorised person at the Ministry of Welfare approved going on` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "תשולם לתקופה שלא תעלה על שישה חודשים מהמועד שבו הוגשה התביעה ... אלא אם כן אישר הגורם שהוסמך לכך במשרד הרווחה והשירותים החברתיים את המשך התשלום"

§ `First Schedule items 2 to 4`

-- item 2: one who has reached 18 and was paid the benefit before reaching 18 by virtue of item 1.
-- src:423 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים ושולמה לו גמלה לפני הגיעו לגיל 18 שנים מכוח הוראות {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 1 פרט 1|פסקה (1)}};
@ref sch 1 item 2 (src:423)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `was paid the benefit before reaching 18 by virtue of item 1` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 2 the person aged 18 or over was paid under item 1 before reaching 18` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `was paid the benefit before reaching 18 by virtue of item 1`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the item is for one who has reached 18 and was paid under item 1

-- item 3: a parent of a child in his custody.
-- src:426 | {{ח:ת}} הורה לילד שבהחזקתו;
@ref sch 1 item 3 (src:426)
GIVEN `a parent of a child in the person's custody` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 3 the person is a parent of a child in their custody` MEANS
    IF `a parent of a child in the person's custody` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 4: one whose spouse is entitled to the benefit, provided he is not entitled to it under s 4(b).
-- src:429 | {{ח:ת}} בן זוגו זכאי לגמלה, ובלבד שאינו זכאי לגמלה לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 4|סעיף 4(ב)}};
@ref sch 1 item 4 (src:429)
GIVEN `the spouse is entitled to the benefit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is entitled under s 4(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 4 the person's spouse is entitled` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (NOT `the spouse is entitled to the benefit`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the item is for one whose spouse is entitled
        IF `the person is entitled under s 4(b)` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "ובלבד שאינו זכאי לגמלה לפי סעיף 4(ב)"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

§ `First Schedule items 5 to 7 -- pregnant women`

-- item 5: a pregnant woman living with her parents who receive the benefit, or with one of them.  Her benefit is the rate in item (1) of the
-- Second Schedule less 5% of the basic amount, and s 5(b) to (f) apply as if it were computed under s 5(a).  The column of item (1) is not named:
-- she is under 25 and so not at retirement age, so s 5(a)(2)(a) gives column B (under 55).
-- src:432 | {{ח:ת}} אישה הרה הגרה עם הוריה המקבלים גמלה, או עם אחד מהם המקבל גמלה; הגמלה לאישה הרה כאמור תהיה בסכום השווה לשיעור הנקוב {{ח:פנימי|תוספת 2 פרט 1|בפרט (1) בתוספת השניה}}, בניכוי סכום השווה ל־5% מהסכום הבסיסי, והוראות {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 5|סעיפים 5(ב) עד (ו)}} יחולו לגביה כאילו חושבה לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 5|סעיף 5(א)}};
@ref sch 1 item 5 (src:432)
GIVEN `a pregnant woman` IS A BOOLEAN
      `lives with her parents who receive the benefit, or with one of them` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 5 the woman lives with her parents who receive the benefit` MEANS
    IF `a pregnant woman` AND `lives with her parents who receive the benefit, or with one of them` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

@ref sch 1 item 5 (src:432)
GIVEN figures IS A Figures
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`sch 1 item 5 the benefit before income` MEANS
    CONSIDER `sch 2 the rate in the table cell` 1 `column B under 55`
    WHEN JUST rate THEN JUST ((rate MINUS 5%) TIMES figures's `the basic amount`)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): no such row in the table

-- item 6: a pregnant woman who does not live with her parents, or with one of them.
-- src:435 | {{ח:ת}} אישה הרה שאינה גרה עם הוריה, או עם אחד מהם;
@ref sch 1 item 6 (src:435)
GIVEN `a pregnant woman` IS A BOOLEAN
      `lives with her parents, or with one of them` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 6 the woman does not live with her parents` MEANS
    IF `a pregnant woman` AND (NOT `lives with her parents, or with one of them`) THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): a pregnant woman who lives with parents who do NOT receive the benefit is in neither item 5 nor item 6

-- item 7: a pregnant woman aged 18 or over, from the 13th week of her pregnancy (the first week of the pregnancy is week 1).
-- src:438 | {{ח:ת}} אישה הרה שמלאו לה 18 שנים, החל בשבוע ה־13 להריונה;
@ref sch 1 item 7 (src:438)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `a pregnant woman` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the week of the pregnancy she is in` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 7 a pregnant woman aged 18 or over in or after week 13` MEANS
    IF `a pregnant woman` AND `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `the week of the pregnancy she is in` AT LEAST 13
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

§ `First Schedule items 8 to 10 -- distress, release from prison, illness`

-- item 8: one aged 18 or over in severe distress because of a disaster or a sudden unforeseen event; the entitlement is for at most two
-- consecutive months.
-- src:441 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים והוא נקלע למצב מצוקה חמור עקב אסון או מאורע פתאומי ובלתי צפוי; זכאות לגמלה לפי פרט זה תהא לתקופה שלא תעלה על שני חודשים רצופים;
@ref sch 1 item 8 (src:441)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `in severe distress because of a disaster or a sudden unforeseen event` IS A BOOLEAN
      `consecutive months already paid under this item` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 8 severe distress` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `in severe distress because of a disaster or a sudden unforeseen event` AND `consecutive months already paid under this item` LESS THAN 2
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the item is for one of 18 or over in such distress, for at most two consecutive months

-- item 9: one aged 18 or over who served arrest or imprisonment (or both) for six consecutive months at least, as long as two months have
-- not passed since release; the entitlement is for at most two consecutive months.
-- src:444 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים וריצה, במשך תקופה של שישה חודשים רצופים לפחות, מעצר או מאסר או שניהם, כל עוד לא חלפה תקופה של חודשיים מיום שחרורו; זכאות לגמלה לפי פרט זה תהא לתקופה שלא תעלה על שני חודשים רצופים;
@ref sch 1 item 9 (src:444)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `months served in arrest or imprisonment, consecutively` IS A NUMBER
      `complete months since release` IS A NUMBER
      `consecutive months already paid under this item` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 9 release from arrest or imprisonment` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `age in completed years` LESS THAN 18 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the item is for one of 18 or over
        IF `months served in arrest or imprisonment, consecutively` LESS THAN 6 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the item is for one who served six consecutive months at least
        IF `complete months since release` AT LEAST 2 THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "כל עוד לא חלפה תקופה של חודשיים מיום שחרורו"
        IF `consecutive months already paid under this item` AT LEAST 2 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "תהא לתקופה שלא תעלה על שני חודשים רצופים"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- item 10: one aged 18 or over unable to work in any work because of an illness lasting more than 30 consecutive days; from a day not
-- earlier than the first of the month in which the 30 days were completed; for at most 6 months; provided that if he is entitled to payment from
-- any source for the period of not working, he is entitled to the benefit if that payment is below the benefit fixed by s 5 for his family composition.
-- src:447 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים והוא אינו מסוגל לעבוד בעבודה כלשהי בגלל מחלה הנמשכת יותר מ־30 ימים רצופים; הזכאות לגמלה לפי פרט זה תהיה ממועד שלא יקדם ל־1 בחודש שבו מלאו 30 ימי המחלה הרצופים, ותימשך לא יותר מ־6 חודשים, ובלבד שאם הוא זכאי לתשלום ממקור כלשהו בעד תקופת אי עבודתו כאמור, יהיה זכאי לגמלה אם התשלום נמוך מסכום הגמלה הקבוע לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 5|סעיף 5}} בהתאם להרכב משפחתו;
@ref sch 1 item 10 (src:447)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `unable to work in any work because of an illness` IS A BOOLEAN
      `consecutive days of the illness` IS A NUMBER
      `complete months already paid under this item` IS A NUMBER
      `payment from any source for the period of not working` IS A NUMBER
      `the benefit fixed by s 5 for his family composition` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 10 illness lasting more than 30 days` MEANS
    -- Why one failure here is a no and the others are not: "ובלבד שאם הוא זכאי לתשלום ממקור כלשהו ... יהיה זכאי לגמלה אם התשלום נמוך" is a proviso ("provided that"), which the rule
    -- of 2026-10-29 lists among the words that say no; the age of 18, the illness lasting more than 30 days, the 6 months and the inability to work because of an illness are
    -- a stated period, a stated age and a named complement that limit the item in its own wording, which the rule lists among the words that do not.
    BRANCH
        IF `age in completed years` LESS THAN 18 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the item is for one of 18 or over
        IF (NOT `unable to work in any work because of an illness`) THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)
        IF `consecutive days of the illness` AT MOST 30 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "הנמשכת יותר מ־30 ימים רצופים"
        IF `complete months already paid under this item` AT LEAST 6 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "ותימשך לא יותר מ־6 חודשים"
        IF `payment from any source for the period of not working` GREATER THAN 0 AND `payment from any source for the period of not working` AT LEAST `the benefit fixed by s 5 for his family composition` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "ובלבד שאם הוא זכאי לתשלום ממקור כלשהו ... יהיה זכאי לגמלה אם התשלום נמוך מסכום הגמלה"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

-- item 10: the earliest day from which the entitlement runs is the first of the month in which the 30 days of illness were completed.
@ref sch 1 item 10 (src:447)
GIVEN `the day on which the 30 days of illness were completed` IS A DATE
GIVETH A DATE
`sch 1 item 10 the earliest day of entitlement` MEANS
    Date 1 (DATE_MONTH `the day on which the 30 days of illness were completed`) (DATE_YEAR `the day on which the 30 days of illness were completed`)

§ `First Schedule items 11 to 17 -- treatment, incapacity, injury, community service, sheltered work`

-- item 11: aged 18 or over, treated in an institution or in drug withdrawal under a court probation order, or under the supervision of a
-- probation officer under the Arrests Law.
-- src:450 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים והוא מטופל במוסד או נמצא בתהליך גמילה מסם על פי צו מבחן של בית המשפט או בפיקוחו של קצין מבחן לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק סדר הדין הפלילי (סמכויות אכיפה – מעצרים)|חוק המעצרים}}; לענין זה, ”מוסד“, ”סם“ ו”צו מבחן“ – כהגדרתם {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|בסעיף 2(א)(1)}};
@ref sch 1 item 11 (src:450)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `treated in an institution or in drug withdrawal under a court probation order` IS A BOOLEAN
      `under the supervision of a probation officer under the Arrests Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 11 treatment under a probation order or supervision` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND (`treated in an institution or in drug withdrawal under a court probation order` OR `under the supervision of a probation officer under the Arrests Law`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 12: aged 18 or over, whom a drug-addiction diagnosis centre approved by the Minister found not placeable in any work.
-- src:453 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים ומרכז לאבחון מתמכרים לסמים שאישר השר, קבע כי הוא אינו ניתן להשמה בעבודה כלשהי;
@ref sch 1 item 12 (src:453)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `a drug-addiction diagnosis centre approved by the Minister found the person not placeable in any work` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 12 found not placeable by a diagnosis centre` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `a drug-addiction diagnosis centre approved by the Minister found the person not placeable in any work`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 13: aged 18 or over whom an alcoholics treatment centre under the supervision of the Ministry of Labour and Welfare recognised as
-- addicted to alcohol, or who is in withdrawal at that centre.
-- src:456 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים ומרכז לטיפול באלכוהוליסטים, המצוי בפיקוח משרד העבודה והרווחה, הכיר בו כמכור לאלכוהול, או שהוא מצוי בתהליך גמילה באותו מרכז;
@ref sch 1 item 13 (src:456)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `recognised as addicted to alcohol by an alcoholics treatment centre under the supervision of the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in withdrawal at that centre` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 13 an alcoholics treatment centre` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND (`recognised as addicted to alcohol by an alcoholics treatment centre under the supervision of the Ministry` OR `in withdrawal at that centre`)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 14: aged 18 or over with a determined degree of incapacity to earn of 75% at least under chapter 9 of the Insurance Law.
-- src:459 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים ונקבעה לגביו דרגת אי כושר להשתכר של 75% לפחות לפי הוראות {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#פרק ט|פרק ט׳ בחוק הביטוח}};
@ref sch 1 item 14 (src:459)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `the degree of incapacity to earn determined under chapter 9 of the Insurance Law, in percent` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 14 incapacity to earn of 75% or more` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the degree of incapacity to earn determined under chapter 9 of the Insurance Law, in percent`
    WHEN JUST degree THEN IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND degree AT LEAST 75 THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the item is for a determined degree of 75% at least
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): no degree was determined

-- item 15: aged 18 or over, receiving injury allowance under sub-chapter D of chapter 5 of the Insurance Law.
-- src:462 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים והוא מקבל דמי פגיעה לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#פרק ה סימן ד|סימן ד׳ בפרק ה׳ בחוק הביטוח}};
@ref sch 1 item 15 (src:462)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `receives injury allowance under sub-chapter D of chapter 5 of the Insurance Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 15 injury allowance` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `receives injury allowance under sub-chapter D of chapter 5 of the Insurance Law` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 16: aged 18 or over, serving a sentence of imprisonment by community service under sub-chapter B1 of chapter 6 of the Penal Law.
-- src:465 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים והוא נושא מאסר בעבודות שירות לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק העונשין#פרק ו סימן ב1|סימן ב׳1 בפרק ו׳ בחוק העונשין}};
@ref sch 1 item 16 (src:465)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `serving imprisonment by community service under the Penal Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 16 imprisonment by community service` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `serving imprisonment by community service under the Penal Law` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 17: aged 18 or over, working for health reasons in a sheltered workshop the Minister set, at the scope of work usual there.
-- src:468 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים והוא עובד מטעמי בריאות במפעל מוגן שקבע השר, בהיקף העבודה המקובל בו;
@ref sch 1 item 17 (src:468)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `works for health reasons in a sheltered workshop the Minister set` IS A BOOLEAN
      `at the scope of work usual there` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 17 sheltered workshop` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `works for health reasons in a sheltered workshop the Minister set` AND `at the scope of work usual there` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

§ `First Schedule items 18 to 21`

-- item 18: aged 18 or over, and either (a) released on bail on conditions under s 48 of the Arrests Law that include a ban on leaving the
-- home or a limit on leaving it which, in the opinion of an Institute worker authorised for it, prevent integration into work, or held in
-- electronic-monitoring detention under s 22B in conditions that prevent integration into work; or (b) his child or spouse was released on such
-- bail or held in such detention, and he is a guarantor (s 49 or s 22D(2)) for the condition banning or limiting exit, and in the opinion of an
-- authorised Institute worker the guarantee prevents him from integrating into work.  The opinion of the Institute worker is an input.
-- src:471 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים ומתקיים בו אחד מאלה:
-- src:472 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} הוא שוחרר בערובה בתנאים כאמור {{ח:חיצוני|חוק סדר הדין הפלילי (סמכויות אכיפה – מעצרים)#סעיף 48|בסעיף 48 לחוק סדר הדין הפלילי (סמכויות אכיפה – מעצרים), התשנ״ו–1996}} (בפסקה זו – חוק המעצרים), ונקבע לגביו איסור יציאה ממקום המגורים או הגבלה על יציאה כאמור, אשר לדעת עובד המוסד לביטוח לאומי שמינהלת המוסד הסמיכה לכך, מונעים ממנו להשתלב בעבודה או שהוא נעצר בפיקוח אלקטרוני כאמור {{ח:חיצוני|חוק סדר הדין הפלילי (סמכויות אכיפה – מעצרים)#סעיף 22ב|בסעיף 22ב לחוק המעצרים}}, בתנאים המונעים ממנו להשתלב בעבודה;
-- src:473 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} ילדו או בן זוגו שוחררו בערובה בתנאים כאמור {{ח:חיצוני|חוק סדר הדין הפלילי (סמכויות אכיפה – מעצרים)#סעיף 48|בסעיף 48 לחוק המעצרים}} או הוטל עליהם מעצר בפיקוח אלקטרוני כאמור {{ח:חיצוני|חוק סדר הדין הפלילי (סמכויות אכיפה – מעצרים)#סעיף 22ב|בסעיף 22ב לחוק האמור}}, והוא ערב, לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק סדר הדין הפלילי (סמכויות אכיפה – מעצרים)#סעיף 49|סעיף 49}} או {{ח:חיצוני|חוק סדר הדין הפלילי (סמכויות אכיפה – מעצרים)#סעיף 22ד|סעיף 22ד(2) לחוק האמור}}, לפי העניין, למילוי של תנאי הקובע איסור יציאה של ילדו או בן זוגו ממקום המגורים, או הגבלה על יציאה כאמור, ולדעת עובד המוסד לביטוח לאומי שמינהלת המוסד הסמיכה לכך, ערבות זו מונעת ממנו להשתלב בעבודה;
@ref sch 1 item 18 (src:471-473)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `released on bail with a ban or limit on leaving the home` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in the opinion of an authorised Institute worker the ban or limit prevents integration into work` IS A BOOLEAN
      `held in electronic-monitoring detention in conditions that prevent integration into work` IS A BOOLEAN
      `a child or spouse was released on such bail or held in such detention` IS A BOOLEAN
      `is a guarantor for the condition banning or limiting exit` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in the opinion of an authorised Institute worker the guarantee prevents integration into work` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 18 bail and electronic monitoring` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `age in completed years` LESS THAN 18 THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)
        IF `released on bail with a ban or limit on leaving the home` AND `in the opinion of an authorised Institute worker the ban or limit prevents integration into work` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `held in electronic-monitoring detention in conditions that prevent integration into work` THEN JUST TRUE
        IF `a child or spouse was released on such bail or held in such detention` AND `is a guarantor for the condition banning or limiting exit` AND `in the opinion of an authorised Institute worker the guarantee prevents integration into work` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 19: aged 18 or over, treated by the social services bureau of the Ministry of Labour and Welfare and defined by it as sleeping rough.
-- src:476 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים והוא מטופל על ידי הלשכה לשירותים חברתיים במשרד העבודה והרווחה ומוגדר על ידה כדר רחוב;
@ref sch 1 item 19 (src:476)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `treated by the social services bureau and defined by it as sleeping rough` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 19 sleeping rough` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `treated by the social services bureau and defined by it as sleeping rough` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 20: aged 18 or over, in a rehabilitation framework supervised by a government ministry, the Institute or the Prisoners' Rehabilitation Authority.
-- src:479 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים והוא נמצא במסגרת שיקומית בפיקוח משרד ממשלתי, המוסד לביטוח לאומי או הרשות כהגדרתה {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הרשות לשיקום האסיר|בחוק הרשות לשיקום האסיר, התשמ״ג–1983}};
@ref sch 1 item 20 (src:479)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `in a rehabilitation framework supervised by a government ministry, the Institute or the Prisoners' Rehabilitation Authority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 20 rehabilitation framework` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `in a rehabilitation framework supervised by a government ministry, the Institute or the Prisoners' Rehabilitation Authority` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 21: aged 18 or over, who meets the conditions set by regulations under s 2(a)(7) (main time devoted to caring for a sick spouse or
-- child who needs constant supervision).  The s 2(a)(7) result is carried in.
-- src:482 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמלאו לו 18 שנים והתקיימו בו התנאים שנקבעו לפי {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|פסקה (7) בסעיף 2(א)}};
@ref sch 1 item 21 (src:482)
GIVEN `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `the person meets s 2(a)(7)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 21 the conditions of s 2(a)(7) are met` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 THEN `the person meets s 2(a)(7)` ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the item is for one of 18 or over

§ `First Schedule items 22 to 26`

-- item 22: one paid a dependants' allowance under sub-chapter H of chapter 5 or a survivors' allowance under sub-chapter D of chapter 11 of the Insurance Law.
-- src:485 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמשתלמת לו קצבת תלויים לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#פרק ה סימן ח|סימן ח׳ בפרק ה׳ בחוק הביטוח}} או קצבת שאירים לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#פרק יא סימן ד|סימן ד׳ בפרק י״א בחוק האמור}};
@ref sch 1 item 22 (src:485)
GIVEN `paid a dependants' allowance under sub-chapter H of chapter 5 of the Insurance Law` IS A BOOLEAN
      `paid a survivors' allowance under sub-chapter D of chapter 11 of the Insurance Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 22 dependants' or survivors' allowance` MEANS
    IF `paid a dependants' allowance under sub-chapter H of chapter 5 of the Insurance Law` OR `paid a survivors' allowance under sub-chapter D of chapter 11 of the Insurance Law` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 23: a new immigrant aged 18 or over who studies at an ulpan on a referral of the Ministry of Immigrant Absorption.  Whether the person is a
-- "new immigrant" is s 1's definition (carried in as a MAYBE BOOLEAN).
-- src:488 | {{ח:ת}} עולה חדש שמלאו לו 18 שנים והוא לומד באולפן לפי הפניית המשרד לקליטת העליה;
@ref sch 1 item 23 (src:488)
GIVEN `the person is a new immigrant` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `age in completed years` IS A NUMBER
      `studies at an ulpan on a referral of the Ministry of Immigrant Absorption` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 23 a new immigrant studying at an ulpan` MEANS
    IF `age in completed years` AT LEAST 18 AND `studies at an ulpan on a referral of the Ministry of Immigrant Absorption`
    THEN `the person is a new immigrant`
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 24: one paid a disability allowance as a housewife under sub-chapter B of chapter 9 of the Insurance Law.
-- src:491 | {{ח:ת}} מי שמשתלמת לה קצבת נכות כעקרת בית לפי {{ח:חיצוני|חוק הביטוח הלאומי#פרק ט סימן ב|סימן ב׳ בפרק ט׳ לחוק הביטוח}};
@ref sch 1 item 24 (src:491)
GIVEN `paid a disability allowance as a housewife under sub-chapter B of chapter 9 of the Insurance Law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 24 disability allowance as a housewife` MEANS
    IF `paid a disability allowance as a housewife under sub-chapter B of chapter 9 of the Insurance Law` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 25(a): a child resident of Israel one of whose parents, a resident of Israel, is held in detention or prison for more than 30 days, and
-- who lives with the other parent, who is not a resident of Israel.
-- src:494 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} ילד תושב ישראל, שאחד מהוריו הוא תושב ישראל הנמצא במעצר או במאסר לתקופה העולה על 30 ימים, והוא מתגורר עם הורהו השני שאינו תושב ישראל;
@ref sch 1 item 25(a) (src:494)
GIVEN `a child who is a resident of Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
      `one parent, a resident of Israel, is in detention or prison` IS A BOOLEAN
      `days of that detention or imprisonment` IS A NUMBER
      `lives with the other parent, who is not a resident of Israel` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 25(a) the child of a detained or imprisoned parent` MEANS
    IF `a child who is a resident of Israel` AND `one parent, a resident of Israel, is in detention or prison` AND `days of that detention or imprisonment` GREATER THAN 30 AND `lives with the other parent, who is not a resident of Israel`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)

-- item 25(b): the benefit is at the rate of s 6(d); where two or more children qualify, ONE benefit only is paid, at that rate.
-- src:495 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} הגמלה לילד כאמור בפסקת משנה (א) תהיה בשיעור הקבוע {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|בסעיף 6(ד)}}; מתקיים האמור בפסקת משנה (א) בשני ילדים או יותר, תשולם להם גמלה אחת בלבד, בשיעור הקבוע לפי פסקת משנה זו;
@ref sch 1 item 25(b) (src:495)
GIVEN `the number of qualifying children` IS A NUMBER
      `the rate fixed by s 6(d)` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`sch 1 item 25(b) the benefit for the children of a detained or imprisoned parent` MEANS
    IF `the number of qualifying children` AT LEAST 1 THEN JUST `the rate fixed by s 6(d)` ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): no child qualifies

-- item 25(c): the income of the parent may be counted even if he is not a resident, on conditions set by regulations.
-- src:496 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} לעניין גמלה המשולמת לפי הוראות פסקת משנה (א), יכול שתובא בחשבון ההכנסה של ההורה, גם אם אינו תושב ישראל בתנאים שייקבעו בתקנות;
@ref sch 1 item 25(c) (src:496)
GIVEN `the conditions set by the regulations are met` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 25(c) the parent's income may be counted` MEANS
    IF `the conditions set by the regulations are met` THEN JUST TRUE ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): the conditions are in regulations that are not among the sources

-- item 26: a woman who stays in a shelter for battered women, with the approval of the social services department or the Ministry of
-- Welfare, for more than 30 days.  (The same fact as s 2(a)(9); "approval", "social services department" and "shelter for battered women" are
-- as s 7(c)(5) of the Women's Employment Law defines them.)
-- Same words as s 2(a)(9), and the same answer for a stay of 30 days or fewer (NOTHING: a stated period, lawyer reading (b)).  The two differ in one case, no approved
-- stay in a shelter at all: s 2(a)(9) answers JUST FALSE there and this item answers NOTHING.  The reason is where the "as long as" sits: s 2(a)(9) is a limb of the
-- list that s 2(a)'s lead-in introduces with "as long as one of these conditions holds", so a limb that fails is the text's no under reading (a); a Schedule item is a
-- class description that s 2(a)(2A) and s 2(d)(2) refer to ("the conditions fixed for him in the Schedule"), and every item of this Schedule answers NOTHING outside its
-- class unless a proviso says no.  Marginal reading for a lawyer; NOTES "Same words, different kind".
-- src:499 | {{ח:ת}} אישה השוהה במקלט לנשים מוכות באישור המחלקה לשירותים חברתיים או משרד הרווחה והשירותים החברתיים תקופה העולה על 30 ימים; לעניין זה, ”אישור“, ”מחלקה לשירותים חברתיים“ ו”מקלט לנשים מוכות“ – כהגדרתם {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 2|בסעיף 2(א)(9)}}.
@ref sch 1 item 26 (src:499)
GIVEN `a woman` IS A BOOLEAN
      `stays in a shelter for battered women with the approval of the social services department or the Ministry of Welfare` IS A BOOLEAN
      `days of the stay` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 item 26 a shelter for battered women` MEANS
    IF `a woman` AND `stays in a shelter for battered women with the approval of the social services department or the Ministry of Welfare` AND `days of the stay` GREATER THAN 30
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording)
